WEBVTT

00:00:07.483 --> 00:00:08.644
Something bothering you,
Agent?

00:00:09.524 --> 00:00:12.284
I just feel a little guilty
about what I did to Rachel, sir.

00:00:12.444 --> 00:00:15.124
Ah, don't worry about it.
We'll send her a gift card.

00:00:15.664 --> 00:00:17.304
Now,
I propose a toast.

00:00:20.514 --> 00:00:23.233
To a perfectly
executed operation.

00:00:23.349 --> 00:00:25.137
[agent screaming]

00:00:28.483 --> 00:00:29.824
Sir, we're under attack.

00:00:29.933 --> 00:00:31.423
["Barracuda" playing]

00:00:31.533 --> 00:00:34.079
[crashing]
[glass shattering]

00:00:39.242 --> 00:00:41.715
[crashing continues]

00:00:51.243 --> 00:00:53.583
Randall, wifey's home!
[cackles]

00:00:57.502 --> 00:00:59.371
Oh, my God. Rachel.

00:01:01.241 --> 00:01:03.686
♪ You lying so low
In the weeds♪

00:01:03.793 --> 00:01:05.232
[tires screeching]

00:01:05.339 --> 00:01:08.036
♪ I bet you gonna ambush me♪

00:01:08.144 --> 00:01:14.004
♪ You'd have me down, down
Down, down on my knees♪

00:01:14.112 --> 00:01:16.808
♪ Now wouldn't you, barracuda?♪

00:01:19.325 --> 00:01:21.302
♪ Oh♪

00:01:24.934 --> 00:01:27.292
What a woman.

00:01:29.773 --> 00:01:31.134
You no-good,

00:01:32.792 --> 00:01:35.452
lowdown, dirty, lying--

00:01:35.594 --> 00:01:36.634
Rachel,
just listen to me.

00:01:36.653 --> 00:01:38.254
What kind of twisted sicko

00:01:38.254 --> 00:01:40.533
tricks someone
into a fake wedding?

00:01:40.692 --> 00:01:43.203
[weapon clicks, powers up]

00:01:43.363 --> 00:01:45.424
Party's over, Bridezilla.
Stop right there.

00:01:48.023 --> 00:01:49.363
You son of a--

00:01:49.363 --> 00:01:50.403
Have it your way.
No!

00:01:50.523 --> 00:01:52.647
No!
[electrodes buzzing]

00:01:53.247 --> 00:01:55.369
[groaning]

00:01:55.490 --> 00:01:57.933
Oh. Ugh. Oh!

00:01:58.054 --> 00:02:00.094
Very disappointing,
Agent Handel.

00:02:02.714 --> 00:02:04.372
Ha! Is that supposed
to be a weapon?

00:02:04.814 --> 00:02:06.594
I don't know,
but we gonna find out.

00:02:06.832 --> 00:02:08.774
Haven't you caused
enough trouble for one day?

00:02:09.054 --> 00:02:11.234
I haven't even begun
causing trouble.

00:02:12.354 --> 00:02:15.452
Hell hath no fury like
a bride scorned.

00:02:22.073 --> 00:02:24.073
Looks like it's real, huh?
[laughs]

00:02:27.653 --> 00:02:28.653
Whoa! Uh! Ah! Huh?

00:02:28.733 --> 00:02:29.733
No. Right.

00:02:31.533 --> 00:02:34.313
Be honest. How bad is it?

00:02:34.813 --> 00:02:37.754
Not bad at all.
You got Tased. You'll be fine.

00:02:41.764 --> 00:02:43.004
I'm so cold.

00:02:43.403 --> 00:02:45.283
You landed on
our ice sculpture.

00:02:45.389 --> 00:02:46.700
Get up.

00:02:52.826 --> 00:02:54.207
Just--

00:02:54.314 --> 00:02:57.193
Just tell me the truth,
for once.

00:02:58.334 --> 00:03:02.634
Is there anything about you
or about us that was real?

00:03:05.354 --> 00:03:06.654
Rachel, look at me.

00:03:08.054 --> 00:03:09.194
Before I met you,

00:03:09.494 --> 00:03:12.054
I didn't think
that I was even capable
of real happiness.

00:03:13.214 --> 00:03:15.494
But that all changed
when you walked
into my life.

00:03:16.653 --> 00:03:19.434
And I ended up breaking
the first rule
of undercover work.

00:03:20.193 --> 00:03:21.193
Which is?

00:03:22.334 --> 00:03:23.493
Never fall in love.

00:03:34.738 --> 00:03:36.594
[door lock beeps, clicks]

00:03:37.224 --> 00:03:38.464
[Tom] Maddie!
[Sonic] Maddie!

00:03:38.584 --> 00:03:40.964
We're busting out of here.
How'd you get past
the guards?

00:03:41.024 --> 00:03:43.042
Because that little fox
is into some crazy stuff.

00:03:43.363 --> 00:03:44.363
Come on.
[laughing]

00:03:44.474 --> 00:03:46.478
Let's go.
You're amazing.

00:03:57.613 --> 00:04:01.013
The Owls were fools to think
they could hide this.

00:04:09.274 --> 00:04:10.841
Ah.

00:04:14.049 --> 00:04:15.895
[chiming]

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.126
[rumbling]

00:04:39.074 --> 00:04:40.074
What's happening?

00:04:42.014 --> 00:04:43.234
Wait for it.

00:04:48.704 --> 00:04:50.862
[exclaims]

00:04:50.973 --> 00:04:55.402
[cackling]

00:04:55.514 --> 00:04:57.234
Yes. Eureka!

00:04:58.754 --> 00:05:00.093
I've found it!

00:05:08.685 --> 00:05:10.346
[explosion]

00:05:19.894 --> 00:05:20.894
Sonic.

00:05:22.464 --> 00:05:24.924
What is that?
A big problem.

00:05:25.724 --> 00:05:27.484
The compass led Robotnik
to the Emerald.

00:05:27.684 --> 00:05:29.404
That's got to be
hundreds of miles away.

00:05:31.083 --> 00:05:32.083
All right.

00:05:32.724 --> 00:05:34.083
Huddle up.
Let's figure out a plan.

00:05:34.663 --> 00:05:35.663
Together.

00:05:35.663 --> 00:05:36.823
There's no time for that.

00:05:36.943 --> 00:05:38.783
I'm the only one
that can get there fast enough.

00:05:38.903 --> 00:05:41.384
Sonic, this is way too big
for you to do by yourself.

00:05:42.403 --> 00:05:43.943
You see that little fox
over there?

00:05:44.283 --> 00:05:47.283
He came all the way
across the universe
to meet his hero.

00:05:47.484 --> 00:05:50.443
And what did his hero do?
I practically got him killed.

00:05:50.824 --> 00:05:52.924
You know what?
You were right.

00:05:53.604 --> 00:05:55.604
My moment came
and I blew it.

00:05:56.323 --> 00:05:57.323
I'm no hero.

00:05:57.744 --> 00:05:58.744
Wait.
[Sonic] No.

00:05:58.784 --> 00:06:00.304
I'm not letting
anyone else get hurt

00:06:00.304 --> 00:06:01.204
because of me.

00:06:01.204 --> 00:06:02.824
I'm gonna fix this
while I still can.

00:06:04.644 --> 00:06:05.644
Sonic!
[gasps]

00:06:06.464 --> 00:06:07.464
Sonic, wait!
[grunts]

00:06:07.601 --> 00:06:09.803
[groaning]

00:06:09.940 --> 00:06:13.564
Hold on. Wait.
Don't move.

00:06:13.703 --> 00:06:15.003
Take it easy, little guy.
You're hurt.

00:06:15.224 --> 00:06:18.224
But we have to help him.
You don't know
what he's up against.

